      "revision_id": 2180533,
      "line": 92,
      "raw_start": 6983,
      "raw_end": 6991,
      "quote": "從兄導以棱有政事"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/jin079-lang-zhong-xuan-dai/external/jin076-ws2180533.wikitext",
      "raw_sha256": "872701db949f6f58ea6f183425617dfa82353177d2cc026037bfad953a60cd71",
      "revision_id": 2180533,
      "line": 92,
      "raw_start": 7011,
      "raw_end": 7020,
      "quote": "棱知從兄敦驕傲自負"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/jin079-lang-zhong-xuan-dai/external/jin076-ws2180533.wikitext",
      "raw_sha256": "872701db949f6f58ea6f183425617dfa82353177d2cc026037bfad953a60cd71",
      "revision_id": 2180533,
      "line": 92,
      "raw_start": 7071,
      "raw_end": 7082,
      "quote": "敦不能容，潛使人害之。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/jin079-lang-zhong-xuan-dai/external/jin076-ws2180533.wikitext",
      "raw_sha256": "872701db949f6f58ea6f183425617dfa82353177d2cc026037bfad953a60cd71",
      "revision_id": 2180533,
      "line": 94,
      "raw_start": 7084,
      "raw_end": 7103,
      "quote": "弟侃，亦知名，少曆顯職，位至吳國內史。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/jin079-lang-zhong-xuan-dai/external/jin076-ws2180533.wikitext",
      "raw_sha256": "872701db949f6f58ea6f183425617dfa82353177d2cc026037bfad953a60cd71",
      "revision_id": 2180533,
      "line": 48,
      "raw_start": 3629,
      "raw_end": 3641,
      "quote": "彬從兄豫章太守棱為敦所害"
    }
  ],
  "family_distinctions": [
    "王棱為琛之子，琛同時為彬季父。侃是棱弟。",
    "王敦與王導分別為棱的從兄；「君昔歲害兄」為彬對敦說的話。棱、彬先後都任豫章，並非同人。",
    "卷四十五劉暾傳另見西晉洛陽令王棱，這段未以同名作合一判定。"
  ],
